  "starterCode": "def solve(sequences, pad_id=0):\n    pass",
  "solution": "### 💡 Intuition & Approach\nVectorized, mathematically sound implementation.\n\n### ⚡ Implementation\n```python\ndef solve(sequences, pad_id=0):\n    m=max((len(s) for s in sequences),default=0)\n    ids=[list(s)+[pad_id]*(m-len(s)) for s in sequences]\n    mask=[[1]*len(s)+[0]*(m-len(s)) for s in sequences]\n    return ids,mask\n```\n\n### ⏱️ Complexity Analysis\n- **Time Complexity**: $\\mathcal{O}(N)$\n- **Space Complexity**: $\\mathcal{O}(N)$",
